Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Annyeongz 平行宇宙 (the "Site Owner").
All Rights Reserved.

1. What this site is

   Annyeongz 平行宇宙 (the "Site") is an index of fan fiction. It stores
   bibliographic data and links to works hosted on third-party platforms
   (Postype, Lofter, AO3, AsianFanfics and others). It does not host the
   text of any work.

2. Original works belong to their authors

   The copyright of every fan fiction work listed on the Site belongs to
   its original author and/or translator. Nothing in this file claims any
   right over those works. Links point to the authors' own pages; please
   read, share and credit the works according to each author's wishes.

3. Editorial content belongs to the Site Owner

   The following are original editorial content created by the Site Owner
   and are protected by copyright:

   - the classification scheme and facet definitions;
   - the tagging, curation and organisation of works;
   - the reading guides, descriptions and author introductions;
   - the dataset as a whole (including data.json and the CSV / JSON files
     under _build/), being a selection and arrangement made by the
     Site Owner;
   - the site's source code, templates, styles and build scripts.

4. What you may do

   - Browse the Site and follow its links.
   - Quote a short excerpt of the editorial content, with attribution and
     a link back to the Site, for the purpose of commentary or discussion.

5. What you may not do without prior written permission

   - Copy, mirror, scrape or redistribute the dataset, in whole or in
     substantial part, in any form.
   - Fork, clone or reuse the Site's structure, source code, templates or
     build scripts to run another site or service.
   - Reproduce, translate or adapt the editorial content (classification,
     tags, guides, author introductions).
   - Present the editorial content as your own or remove attribution.

   The repository being publicly visible on GitHub does not grant any
   licence. "Fork" buttons and GitHub's Terms of Service allow viewing and
   forking within GitHub only; they do not permit any use listed above.

6. Contact

   To request permission, open an issue in this repository or contact the
   Site Owner through the channels listed on the Site.

